<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
 <style>
:root {
    --navy: #003366;
    --cream: #fff8dc;
    --accent: #cc3300;
    --text: #333333;
    --card: #ffffff;

html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scroll-padding-top: 70px; /* keeps :target sections clear of the sticky nav */
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text);
    background-color: var(--cream);
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 20px;
    counter-reset: section; /* numbers each section heading */
}
header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

#title {
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 0;
}

.tagline {
    margin-top: 4px;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: bold;
}

nav {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 10;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 10px 0;
    background-color: var(--cream);
}

nav a {
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background-color: var(--navy);
}

a {
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
}

a:link,
a:visited {
    color: var(--navy);
}

nav a:link,
nav a:visited {
    color: #ffffff;
}

a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
}

nav a:hover {
    background-color: var(--accent);
    color: #ffffff;
}

a:active {
    color: orange;
}

a:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset: 2px;
}

a[href^="https"]::after {
    content: " \2197";
    font-size: 0.8em;
}

a[href^="#"]:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
}

a[href="#top"] {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border: 2px solid var(--navy);
    border-radius: 6px;
}

a[href="#top"]:hover {
    background-color: var(--navy);
    color: #ffffff;
}

.section {
    background-color: var(--card);
    padding: 20px;
    margin: 15px 0;
    border: 2px solid var(--navy);
    border-radius: 10px;
    transition: background-color 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
}

.section:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
}

.section:target {
    background-color: lightyellow;
    border: 2px solid orange;
}

.section h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    color: var(--navy);
    counter-increment: section;
}

.section h2::before {
    content: "0" counter(section) " ";
    color: var(--accent);
}

.section p {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
}

.section p:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 0;
}

b, strong {
    color: var(--navy);
}

.section mark {
    background-color: var(--cream);
    color: var(--text);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
}

#intro p::first-letter {
    font-size: 2.2em;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: var(--accent);
}

::selection {
    background-color: var(--navy);
    color: #ffffff;
}

.chips {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
}

.chips li {
    padding: 2px 12px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background-color: var(--cream);
    border: 1px solid var(--navy);
    font-size: 0.85em;
}
.chips li:nth-child(even) {
    background-color: var(--navy);
    color: #ffffff;
}

.goals {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    padding-left: 22px;
}

.goals li {
    padding: 2px 0;
}

.goals li:first-child {
    font-weight: bold;
}

.goals li:not(:last-child) {
    border-bottom: 1px dashed #cccccc;
}

.goals li::marker {
    color: var(--accent);
}
footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 10px 0 20px;
}

@media (max-width: 480px) {
    body {
        font-size: 16px;
    }

    nav {
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
}
</style>
<!-- profile-styled.html -->
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Ivan James S. Sargado - Personal Profile</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body id="top">

    <header>
        <h1 id="title">Ivan James S. Sargado</h1>
        <p class="tagline">First Year, BS Computer Science</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#intro">About Me</a>
        <a href="#hobbies">Hobbies</a>
        <a href="#interests">Interests</a>
        <a href="#funfact">Fun Fact</a>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <section class="section" id="intro">
            <h2>About Me</h2>
            <p>Hi my name is <b>Ivan</b>, I'm a first year <strong>BS Computer Science</strong> student.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="hobbies">
            <h2>Hobbies</h2>
            <p>I love to play <em>online games</em> and watch videos on tiktok. I like to explore the <i>Earth's past</i> and know the different species lived in the past.</p>
            <ul class="chips">
                <li>Online games</li>
                <li>TikTok</li>
                <li>Earth's past</li>
                <li>Prehistoric species</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="interests">
            <h2>Interests</h2>
            <p>I enjoy eating and tasting different kinds of food. I want to learn about <mark>coding</mark> and also to play a <mark>stringed instrument</mark>.</p>
            <ul class="goals">
                <li>Tasting different kinds of food</li>
                <li>Learning about coding</li>
                <li>Playing a stringed instrument</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="funfact">
            <h2>Fun Fact</h2>
            <p>Fun fact about me is that I sometimes look like I'm not the kind of person you enjoy to be with, but once you get to know me, you'll know how I'm easy to get along with.</p>
            <p class="links">Find me watching: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/">Youtube</a></p>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <a href="#top">Back to top</a>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
